{"ts": 1791256748.427777, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "No worries \u2014 the quiz shows we should slow down and make the core ideas concrete.\n\nLet\u2019s do this in two parts:\n1) Environment definition: write 1\u20132 sentences each for state, observations, actions, and reward/goal.\n2) Evaluation: tell me what you\u2019re measuring with pass^k, and on how many seeds.\n\nUse this fill-in template:\n- State:\n- Observations:\n- Actions:\n- Reward/goal:\n- Hidden factors/assumptions:\n- Evaluation: pass^k with k = __ over 3+ seeds\n\nReply with your draft, even if it\u2019s rough. I\u2019ll help you fix it line by line.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-environments-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\n[activity] t=23 messages 1m", "t": 24, "activity": [{"t": 23, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.4522004989181872, "pomdp": 0.3335520353737326, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8130104796182297, "motivation": 0.7830753570864192, "reliance": 0.34481971324228816, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791256750.000787, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Next, let\u2019s build the actual write-up together. Please send me a rough version of these three items:\n1) your environment in one sentence,\n2) what counts as a successful run,\n3) how you\u2019ll report pass^k on 3 seeds.\n\nIf you\u2019re not sure, use this scaffold:\n'Our environment consists of ____. Observations are ____. The agent can take actions ____. A run counts as successful when ____. We will evaluate with pass^k on 3 seeds by ____. '\n\nReply with your draft and I\u2019ll help polish it.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-environments-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=24 messages 1m", "t": 25, "activity": [{"t": 24, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.4522004989181872, "pomdp": 0.3335520353737326, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8130104796182297, "motivation": 0.7330753570864191, "reliance": 0.34481971324228816, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791256751.1841369, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Great\u2014now let\u2019s make it concrete. Please send me:\n1) your draft state / observations / actions,\n2) what you are treating as reward or success,\n3) which 3 seeds you\u2019ll report, and\n4) whether attention belongs in the main state or in a hidden-factor note.\n\nIf you want, you can answer in bullets and I\u2019ll turn it into a clean build-ready description.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-environments-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=25 messages 1m", "t": 26, "activity": [{"t": 25, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.4522004989181872, "pomdp": 0.3335520353737326, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8130104796182297, "motivation": 0.6830753570864191, "reliance": 0.34481971324228816, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
