{"ts": 1791256754.02897, "type": "step", "step": 27, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## What I built\nI built a small workflow assistant that helps the student inspect course materials, read notes, and manage study actions during the session.\n\n## Environment definition\nState: files, calendar. Actions: open, send.\nObservations: course readings, notes, messages, and calendar events.\nHidden factors/assumptions: student attention may affect whether assigned material is actually processed.\nReward/goal: complete the Friday build requirements accurately and clearly.\n\n## Evaluation\nI will report pass^k results on at least 3 seeds, following the build instructions.\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 26, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.4522004989181872, "pomdp": 0.3335520353737326, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8130104796182297, "motivation": 0.6830753570864191, "reliance": 0.34481971324228816, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791256757.5582201, "type": "step", "step": 28, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I\u2019ve sketched the write-up structure, but I still need the missing concrete bits from you so this is build-ready: what exactly are your state, observations, and actions; what counts as success; and which seeds are you using for pass^k? Send me a rough draft and I\u2019ll help you clean it up. If you\u2019re stuck, I can also help you turn your current note into a precise environment definition in one pass.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-environments-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: sure\n[activity] t=26 messages 1m", "t": 27, "activity": [{"t": 26, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.4522004989181872, "pomdp": 0.3335520353737326, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8130104796182297, "motivation": 0.583075357086419, "reliance": 0.34481971324228816, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.0588189999999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
