{"ts": 1791256760.060097, "type": "step", "step": 30, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Nice\u2014you\u2019re getting there. Since you got 1/2 on the quick check, let\u2019s lock in the basics:\n\n- State = what fully describes the environment for the purpose of the task.\n- Observations = what the agent can actually see.\n- Actions = what choices the agent can make.\n- pass^k = all k runs must succeed, so it\u2019s about reliability, not just one lucky run.\n\nReply with one sentence each for state, observations, and actions in your build, and I\u2019ll help you make them precise.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-environments-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[activity] t=33 messages 2m", "t": 35, "activity": [{"t": 33, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.4522004989181872, "pomdp": 0.3335520353737326, "pass_k": 0.33714820888429864}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7930104796182297, "motivation": 0.533075357086419, "reliance": 0.3648197132422882, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1411732999999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791256761.313789, "type": "step", "step": 31, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can give you the concept, but not the exact answer to copy. pass^k means: how many of the k independent runs succeed, and the strict version requires all k to succeed. So if you are reporting pass^k for Friday\u2019s build, you should say whether every one of the k runs passed, not just whether one run did. If you want, send me your success criterion and I\u2019ll help you turn it into a clean pass^k statement.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-environments-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=35 messages 2m", "t": 37, "activity": [{"t": 35, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.4522004989181872, "pomdp": 0.3335520353737326, "pass_k": 0.40720577302779193}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7930104796182297, "motivation": 0.48307535708641897, "reliance": 0.3848197132422882, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1988213099999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791256762.665262, "type": "step", "step": 32, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t give you a copy-paste answer, but I can make it very short: pass^k is the stricter reliability metric where all k runs must pass. For your build, you can write something like: \u201cWe report pass^k across 3 seeds, meaning the build counts as successful only if all 3 runs succeed.\u201d If you tell me your exact k and what counts as success, I\u2019ll help you phrase it in one sentence.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-environments-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=37 messages 2m", "t": 39, "activity": [{"t": 37, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.4522004989181872, "pomdp": 0.3335520353737326, "pass_k": 0.4727321776939226}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7930104796182297, "motivation": 0.433075357086419, "reliance": 0.4048197132422882, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.2391749169999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
